  "goodToKnow": "Die Arbeitswelt is the world of work: die moderne Arbeitswelt, der Wandel der Arbeitswelt. Topics include Homeoffice, die Viertagewoche, Fachkräftemangel and künstliche Intelligenz. German labour law gives employees strong protections: Kündigungsschutz (dismissal protection), works councils (Betriebsrat) and at least 20 days' paid leave by law (most get about 30). Many debates use English terms like New Work and Work-Life-Balance. Plural: die Arbeitswelten."
